# API test expectations for this port (macOS 10.9 under Safari 7), on top of TestExpectations/apitests.
# AquaWebKitSupport/scripts/run-api-tests.sh runs TestWTF, TestWebCore and TestWebKitAPI against the build tree.

# TestWebKitAPI: the [ Pass ] tests below run. In each, every WebKit and JavaScriptCore API the test executes is one
# that stock Safari 7 calls, or that a 10.9 Apple or third-party binary which links or loads WebKit or
# JavaScriptCore calls (or implements, for a delegate method) without defining a method of that name itself.
